WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.852
Unit twelve. Sharing a Device Politely!

2
00:00:04.793 --> 00:00:09.040
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.946
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.996 --> 00:00:16.182
Today we learn about Sharing a Device Politely. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:21.597
Share. Say it with me. Share!

6
00:00:25.121 --> 00:00:28.673
Turn. Say it with me. Turn!

7
00:00:32.212 --> 00:00:36.779
Ask nicely. Say it with me. Ask nicely!

8
00:00:40.266 --> 00:00:43.833
Wait. Say it with me. Wait!

9
00:00:47.304 --> 00:00:51.071
Polite. Say it with me. Polite!

10
00:00:54.611 --> 00:00:58.744
Patience. Say it with me. Patience!

11
00:01:02.207 --> 00:01:05.759
Fair. Say it with me. Fair!

12
00:01:09.276 --> 00:01:13.793
Take turns. Say it with me. Take turns!

13
00:01:17.296 --> 00:01:26.608
Sharing a device means taking turns politely. I ask nicely and wait patiently for my turn. Being fair makes sharing easier.

14
00:01:26.658 --> 00:01:30.117
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:30.869 --> 00:01:36.497
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.547 --> 00:01:37.879
Ask nicely!

17
00:01:38.954 --> 00:01:44.339
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:45.539
Fair!

19
00:01:46.414 --> 00:01:52.980
Did you know? Learning to share devices patiently is a helpful skill both at home and at school!

20
00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:55.315
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.389 --> 00:02:05.476
Think and answer. How do you feel when someone shares nicely with you?

22
00:02:05.526 --> 00:02:06.700
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:14.106
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:14.156 --> 00:02:17.467
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

